msgctxt "0"
msgid "Bouquet of Laurel Wreaths"
msgstr ""

#. max 1999 bytes
msgctxt "1"
msgid "Saber's second SG. Its other name is \"Desire for Marriage.\"\n\nRather than a secret, it's a desire; a dream.\nAs she became emperor as a girl, she was unable to have\na wedding ceremony as an ordinary human being.\nFrom that yearning, this SG was given form.\n\n             ◆\n\nHer birthplace, the Italian Peninsula, is surrounded by the\nMediterranean, a hotspot for live volcanoes & earthquakes.\nIn regions like this…… of course, Japan included……\nthere is a tendency for symbols related to fertility and\nsymbols of living motion to be held of higher importance.\nGreatest of them is a crown of laurel―the laurel wreath.\n\nSince Ancient Greece, within Mediterranean civilization,\nthe laurel wreath has traditionally been a symbol of glory \ngranted to the victor of a competition.\nThat's the reason the successive generations of emperors\nwere crowned with laurel wreaths.\n\nOf course, Saber, as an emperor and victor of tournaments,\nhas been crowned with a laurel wreath countless times.\nTo her, there's no mistake that she sees a laurel wreath\nmade into a veil as a treasure without equal.\n"
msgstr ""

